e, and UNKNOWN_NO_BAR/FETCH_FAILED/NO_BAR_CONFIRMED never release feature/signal/entry/exit payloads. Any fetch, semantic, integrity, or checkpoint validation failure must leave CURRENT untouched; an active reader must yield PUBLISH_PENDING and block a new cycle. Do not access real data, network, backtests, KBase, scheduler state, or create a second publication/WAL framework.","outcome":"PASS","phase":"P2","plan_version":"V3.4.2-P0R2","reason_codes":[],"report_payload_sha256":"c9ba721a26380b5e8d8a268fcca1e50ae14f6d3dbfb53709ce0bd16b2d7f79c5","requirements":{"required_evidence_ids":["p2r2-authorization","implementation-baseline","p2r2-t4-task-report","p2r2-t4-completion"],"required_review_receipt_ids":["independent-daily-updater-staging-review"],"required_test_receipt_ids":["daily-updater-staging-tests","daily-updater-publish-pending-tests","p2r2-t5-regression-tests"]},"review_findings":[{"finding_id":"P2R2-T5-REVIEW-001","resolution":"GenerationPublisher now invokes the active candidate validator on CURRENT before clearing a completed pending marker; the regression test proves a tampered CSV leaves PUBLISH_PENDING intact.","review_receipt_id":"independent-daily-updater-staging-review","severity":"BLOCKING","status":"RESOLVED","summary":"Completed-pending recovery could clear its marker based only on manifest identity and bypass the daily candidate validator."},{"finding_id":"P2R2-T5-REVIEW-002","resolution":"stage(), publish(), and recover_pending_publication() now share one publication guard, so validator state cannot bleed across operations on the same publisher.","review_receipt_id":"independent-daily-updater-staging-review","severity":"BLOCKING","status":"RESOLVED","summary":"The candidate validator was shared mutable state while staging could run concurrently with publish or recovery."},{"finding_id":"P2R2-T5-REVIEW-003","resolution":null,"review_receipt_id":"independent-daily-updater-staging-review","severity":"NON_BLOCKING","status":"OPEN","summary":"Separate